### IPL Store API - runnable requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
@api = http://localhost:5080/api/v1
@customer = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Search products (name / type / franchise)
GET {{api}}/products?search=jersey&franchise=CSK,MI&sort=PriceLowToHigh&page=1&pageSize=5

### Product details (Mumbai Indians cap - deterministic id from seed)
GET {{api}}/products?search=MI-CAP

### Franchises & categories (filter drop-downs)
GET {{api}}/franchises

### Cart
GET {{api}}/cart
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

### Add to cart (replace productId with one from the search result)
POST {{api}}/cart/items
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "quantity": 2 }

### Checkout - send the SAME Idempotency-Key again: 200 + Idempotent-Replayed: true, no second order
POST {{api}}/orders
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
Idempotency-Key: 7d6f1c1e-demo-key-0001

### Order history
GET {{api}}/orders
X-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
